{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">四川成都一片萬畝稻田，將大熊貓元素與當地酒文化結合，「畫出」大熊貓懷抱酒罈的圖案，為夏日田園增添亮眼風景。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.SC.PANDA.MTV.0722-0805_002.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026DfNQsNUzTr1785893317.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.SC.PANDA.MTV.0722-0805_002.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.SC.PANDA.MTV.0722-0805.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026WUEZuok9D81785893307.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.SC.PANDA.MTV.0722-0805.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-05T02:00:54.316908+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":53,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}